=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  menu-layout ssh ----------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Adopted 2026-11-14: no Figma frame. The SSH Login row with SSH$
# Auth in it: the worse of the two states, and the details of$
# the parts in that state. A part read as off outranks one not$
# read. Both off alike is the one pair cut at 64 columns.$
$
Both configured:$
  [+] SSH Login            + root disallowed, key-only auth$
$
sshd allows passwords:$
  [ ] SSH Login            Not Configured password auth on$
$
Root may log in:$
  [ ] SSH Login            Not Configured root allowed$
$
Both off, one worse:$
  [ ] SSH Login            Not Configured password auth on$
$
Both off alike:$
  [ ] SSH Login            Not Configured root allowed, passw...$
$
A long detail:$
  [ ] SSH Login            Partial match block allows passwords$
$
Proxmox VE, both configured:$
  [+] SSH Login            + root key-only, key-only auth$
$
Passwords on, root not read:$
  [ ] SSH Login            Not Configured password auth on$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
$
sshd not read:$
  [?] SSH Login            Unknown can't read$
                             ~ Counted as not configured$
$
$

